        "en": "Inflicts \"Befog\" on all enemies. While in \"Befog,\" targets receive #4[i]% increased Break DMG, lasting for #5[i] turn(s).\nDeals Fire DMG equal to #1[i]% of Lingsha's ATK to all enemies, and at the same time restores HP equal to #2[f1]% of Lingsha's ATK plus #3[i] for all allies. Fuyuan's action advances by #6[i]%.",
